WEBVTT

00:02.530 --> 00:03.997
Legend has it...

00:05.199 --> 00:07.997
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.335 --> 00:13.671
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.142 --> 00:20.307
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.427 --> 00:40.856
<i>Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.135 --> 00:46.971
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.509 --> 00:54.414
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.083 --> 00:59.849
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.954 --> 01:03.151
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.894 --> 01:13.993
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.168 --> 01:20.004
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:20.875 --> 01:28.145
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.315 --> 01:36.723
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.424 --> 01:39.085
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.836 --> 01:52.272
<i>Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:55.509 --> 01:56.441
I win!

02:01.448 --> 02:04.474
You fool! You can't
reach me with your fist!

02:10.024 --> 02:10.422
What the...

02:23.137 --> 02:23.831
He did it!

02:25.739 --> 02:30.699
<i>THE ULTIMATE WARRIORS</i>

02:40.988 --> 02:41.977
Yaku...

03:08.882 --> 03:11.214
So, it's my turn, Mutsu.

03:11.418 --> 03:14.444
"Next time we meet, I'll
wipe that grin off your face..."

03:14.655 --> 03:16.520
...that's what I told you.

03:17.958 --> 03:19.949
And now I've run into you...

03:34.742 --> 03:38.678
At last, they meet in battle!

04:00.701 --> 04:02.896
The heavens are shuddering...

04:04.505 --> 04:06.973
Because whoever wins this battle...

04:07.908 --> 04:10.775
...will be the man who
can slash the heavens!

04:20.988 --> 04:22.421
Please, stop this now!

04:23.991 --> 04:26.721
Why are you fighting
each other for no reason?

04:27.895 --> 04:28.953
Big Sister...

04:29.763 --> 04:32.630
It's no use, there's no stopping them.

04:33.133 --> 04:36.830
I've never seen my master look as
determined as he does right now.

04:40.707 --> 04:43.767
This is the battle they've
both been seeking...

04:46.246 --> 04:48.237
Even if you did manage
to stop the fight...

04:49.016 --> 04:50.950
...you would never be forgiven.

04:51.251 --> 04:55.312
Even if by stopping
it you saved his life.

05:01.728 --> 05:03.992
I love my master Musashi.

05:04.498 --> 05:05.965
That's why I'm watching.

05:06.667 --> 05:09.693
All I can do is watch,
and believe he's gonna win.

05:10.237 --> 05:12.262
You have to believe, too, Big Sister.

05:12.806 --> 05:14.296
Believe that Big Brother's gonna win.

05:14.575 --> 05:16.270
Otherwise it won't be fair!

05:18.846 --> 05:19.904
That's right...

05:20.948 --> 05:23.143
Yakumo would never lose...

05:26.253 --> 05:30.713
Perhaps I was wrong when I
said Yakumo was like a cloud.

05:39.566 --> 05:40.555
No...

05:41.535 --> 05:43.628
In meeting this tiger...

05:44.171 --> 05:47.106
...the dragon that lay inside him...

05:47.574 --> 05:50.099
...has been roused from its sleep...

07:03.817 --> 07:05.045
Dodged it...

07:05.652 --> 07:08.212
But it's not like before...

07:08.655 --> 07:12.250
He can't dodge the blow and
then block Musashi's sword arm...

07:29.009 --> 07:30.271
He moved inside this time!

07:45.425 --> 07:46.551
I don't believe it...

07:46.994 --> 07:49.360
Big Brother Yakumo's so powerful!

07:50.297 --> 07:53.027
No one's ever avoided
Musashi's finishing blow!

07:54.901 --> 07:58.860
I knew you were the one
opponent I'd always sought...

08:00.440 --> 08:02.806
One sword's not going to be enough, eh?

08:16.523 --> 08:18.821
If I block that fist
of his, I can't strike!

08:22.329 --> 08:23.261
He struck!

08:23.597 --> 08:24.655
The Double Sword Style...

08:28.335 --> 08:31.736
Damn, I was only off by a mere inch!

08:35.842 --> 08:38.402
He just scratched the
skin on his stomach...

08:38.679 --> 08:41.011
Which of them deserves more praise?

08:41.648 --> 08:45.209
Musashi, who struck with two
swords rather than avoid that punch...

08:45.752 --> 08:50.712
...or Yakumo, who focused on striking
Musashi, rather than dodging him.

09:01.068 --> 09:06.062
So, you're forcing me to face
you with two swords, are you?

09:22.055 --> 09:25.149
Musashi's brandishing two swords...

09:26.159 --> 09:28.525
The Double Sword Style
is Musashi's trademark...

09:28.595 --> 09:34.227
...but no one has ever witnessed him
actually using two swords in a duel.

09:34.935 --> 09:35.924
Because...

09:36.036 --> 09:40.564
...no man has ever been able to
force him to draw both swords.

10:32.793 --> 10:34.317
You might've blocked one sword...

10:34.461 --> 10:37.294
...but in that position,
you can't evade this one!

10:41.668 --> 10:42.498
What?

11:33.987 --> 11:35.955
Very impressive, Mutsu...

11:36.389 --> 11:38.914
Still, even a blow like that...

11:39.159 --> 11:40.990
...isn't enough to defeat me!

12:18.532 --> 12:20.659
You're a ferocious man...

12:20.867 --> 12:24.234
No, it's the Mutsu Enmei
Style that's ferocious.

12:25.238 --> 12:27.331
What do you call that move?

12:28.808 --> 12:33.142
Mutsu Enmei Style Oogi, Mukuuha.

12:35.315 --> 12:38.773
You have defeated me...

12:52.198 --> 12:53.995
Master!

12:57.437 --> 12:58.836
Master!

13:03.443 --> 13:05.570
This battle is a draw.

13:06.880 --> 13:09.508
The Mutsu Enmei Style is
about fighting unarmed.

13:09.983 --> 13:12.918
Unfortunately, I drew my sword.

13:13.353 --> 13:15.048
No, I was forced to draw...

13:15.655 --> 13:18.283
In the history of the Mutsu Enmei Style...

13:18.458 --> 13:20.949
...we've defeated all our
opponents unarmed, except for one...

13:21.027 --> 13:23.495
And that's Musashi Miyamoto.

13:25.432 --> 13:26.456
So it's a draw.

13:26.600 --> 13:28.363
There was no winner.

13:30.503 --> 13:32.596
Tell him that for me, will you?

13:35.475 --> 13:36.703
Master!

13:59.933 --> 14:01.400
Yakumo!

14:03.770 --> 14:05.431
I take it you won, didn't you, Yakumo?

14:05.538 --> 14:07.062
Your Highness, you'll get wet!

14:07.774 --> 14:09.207
No, it's stopped raining now.

14:10.610 --> 14:11.975
Yakumo, I have good news!

14:12.245 --> 14:14.975
Starting today, you're
our new Sword Instructor!

14:15.515 --> 14:19.645
Not to mention we shall be
married in the next few days...

14:21.121 --> 14:24.648
My father said he would consent
if you defeated the Kukis.

14:24.791 --> 14:28.557
That smile of his, it wasn't for me...

14:36.670 --> 14:38.399
Damn! Not again...

14:38.905 --> 14:42.033
Didn't you tell yourself you
were going to give up on Yakumo?

14:43.276 --> 14:45.267
Hey, you! Where are you going?

14:48.848 --> 14:50.748
What's with that look on your face?

14:51.051 --> 14:54.851
I haven't quit my job as
your bodyguard yet, you know!

14:55.055 --> 14:56.522
Yakumo, tell me why!

14:56.756 --> 14:58.189
Why are you turning me down?

15:02.095 --> 15:04.689
I'm a man who'd exchange
his life for 5 mon.

15:04.931 --> 15:09.197
For 15 mon, I'll have to flirt
with death 3 times before I'm done.

15:09.636 --> 15:13.072
I've got a feeling it might
take me the rest of my life...

15:13.206 --> 15:14.537
Yakumo...

15:15.542 --> 15:17.442
Hey, don't make me talk too much.

15:17.977 --> 15:20.673
It's all I can do to stay
on my feet right now...

15:21.014 --> 15:22.413
Yakumo...

15:23.783 --> 15:25.944
Can I lean on your shoulder?

15:26.052 --> 15:26.916
Yes.

15:41.067 --> 15:42.295
Give me that umbrella.

15:42.402 --> 15:43.391
What?

15:43.636 --> 15:45.103
Just do as I say!

15:50.710 --> 15:52.905
What a delightful way to pass the time.

15:53.980 --> 15:55.470
This is for you...

15:55.815 --> 15:57.305
It's a tip...

16:04.290 --> 16:06.451
I must say, that was quite a spectacle.

16:06.559 --> 16:10.723
I doubt I'll ever see anything
to rival it as long as I live...

16:12.599 --> 16:16.296
Master! I'm going to
train with all my might!

16:16.436 --> 16:18.529
I'll train and become powerful!

16:18.805 --> 16:20.966
And someday, I'm going to defeat Mutsu!

16:22.242 --> 16:26.110
Well, now. That might be
another sight to see...

16:26.446 --> 16:31.577
Who knows what awaits the boy who
witnessed this extraordinary clash?

16:37.457 --> 16:42.258
That was the last time I
ever saw Yakumo and Shiori.

16:48.868 --> 16:50.631
Looking back now, I understand...

16:52.405 --> 16:54.805
During the battle with Yakumo Mutsu...

16:54.941 --> 16:57.910
...the look on Musashi's
face was one of pure bliss.

17:01.815 --> 17:05.444
Having already met his match
in that extraordinary warrior...

17:06.052 --> 17:08.987
...the battle with "Ganryu"
Kojiro Sasaki, a mere mortal...

17:10.557 --> 17:14.425
...was not enough to give him any joy.

17:16.362 --> 17:18.421
And for that reason...

17:18.531 --> 17:24.231
...after reigning undefeated in over
60 duels, Musashi put down his swords.

17:27.473 --> 17:29.532
More than 20 years have passed...

17:29.642 --> 17:32.975
...the last of the Toyotomis
were wiped out by Ieyasu...

17:33.279 --> 17:36.009
...and the Tokugawas have
reigned for three generations.

17:36.115 --> 17:38.015
Iemitsu now rules Japan.

17:44.157 --> 17:45.681
Yakumo...

17:47.126 --> 17:50.323
What I wouldn't give for
the chance to duel you now...

17:54.601 --> 17:58.628
We have been ordered to
assemble the top swordsmen...

17:58.938 --> 18:02.271
...in the nation for
the Shogun's Tournament.

18:02.842 --> 18:05.709
You do not need to
tell me, Izu-no-kami.

18:05.945 --> 18:10.279
I, Tajima, have been preparing in
accordance with the Shogun's wishes.

18:10.917 --> 18:14.614
The Shogun's official kenjutsu
schools, your Edo Yagyu Shinkage Style...

18:14.721 --> 18:18.919
...and the Ono Ha Itto Style, shall also
take part in this elimination tournament.

18:19.359 --> 18:21.088
But that is absurd...

18:21.427 --> 18:24.760
Why should the Shogun's own
Swordsmanship Instructors have to...

18:25.431 --> 18:28.992
Entertainment, my
Lord Tajima-no-kami.

18:29.469 --> 18:31.699
One of the Shogun's two...

18:31.804 --> 18:37.037
...kenjutsu styles will emerge
victorious, that is all too obvious.

18:39.445 --> 18:41.879
Damn that Izu-no-Kami,
he's fooling with me!

18:42.548 --> 18:45.244
Father, what is the matter?

18:45.652 --> 18:47.620
He has persuaded the Shogun...

18:47.754 --> 18:51.281
...to order the Edo Yagyu Shinkage
Style to take part in the Tournament.

18:51.991 --> 18:53.185
But for what reason?

18:53.526 --> 18:56.893
He has felt slighted ever
since I was promoted from...

18:57.030 --> 18:59.794
...Sword Instructor to
Sometsuke the year before last.

18:59.866 --> 19:02.357
Undoubtedly, his scheme is
to see our Style disgraced...

19:02.502 --> 19:04.436
...and for me to be stripped of my rank!

19:04.570 --> 19:06.094
How dare he...

19:06.973 --> 19:09.942
And pulling the strings
behind the scenes...

19:10.610 --> 19:13.704
...is that freak of a monk, Tenkai.

19:14.981 --> 19:18.849
To think that he's nearly 100,
and still thirsts for power...

19:21.621 --> 19:25.352
Matajuuro, send a messenger
to our ancestral home...

19:25.491 --> 19:26.515
But, Father!

19:26.826 --> 19:29.852
Listen to me, we cannot
risk disgrace at any cost!

19:30.296 --> 19:32.321
I am summoning Jubei!

19:34.767 --> 19:37.429
Lord Musashi, I beg
of you, please accept!

19:38.071 --> 19:40.869
As you can see, I have grown old...

19:41.474 --> 19:44.443
...and it befits me far better
to pass the time painting.

19:44.777 --> 19:46.369
My lord, this is no time for jokes!

19:46.779 --> 19:49.339
Both of the Shogun's kenjutsu styles...

19:49.515 --> 19:53.349
...the Edo Yagyu Shinkage Style and the
Ono Ha ltto Style, will be represented.

19:53.686 --> 19:56.382
As well, the official sword instructors
for each feudal lord will be taking part...

19:56.489 --> 19:59.287
...we are even seeking the
legendary Mutsu Enmei Style...

19:59.392 --> 20:01.155
...by order of the Shogun himself!

20:01.494 --> 20:03.394
This is a golden opportunity to...

20:03.496 --> 20:06.795
<i>...reassert your renown across the
nation as the swordsman without peer!</i>

20:07.400 --> 20:11.131
Do you actually intend to
ignore the wishes of the Shogun?

20:11.237 --> 20:14.206
If all goes well, there
is talk of a post...

20:14.340 --> 20:17.275
Why do you suppose I still
harbour that kind of ambition?

20:17.377 --> 20:19.538
I am quite content being the
guest of the Ogasawara clan...

20:19.645 --> 20:21.408
That's enough for me.

20:23.216 --> 20:26.344
More importantly, I no longer
wish to confront either...

20:26.452 --> 20:29.012
...Yagyu nor Ono, as they
are not worthy opponents...

20:29.122 --> 20:32.387
Are you that protective of
your undefeated status, then?

20:32.725 --> 20:34.716
I am not undefeated.

20:35.528 --> 20:38.793
However, if you won't
take no for an answer...

20:38.865 --> 20:44.303
...then please send my adopted son Iori,
though his skills are yet unpolished.

20:48.307 --> 20:50.502
So you are Iori, sir?

20:51.477 --> 20:52.569
But Lord Musashi!

20:52.678 --> 20:56.808
You said yourself he is unpolished.
Would that not be disrespectful?

20:56.916 --> 21:00.010
In the event that Iori is defeated...

21:01.754 --> 21:05.212
...then I, Musashi, will
have been defeated...

21:05.958 --> 21:08.153
...you may leave it at that.

21:11.564 --> 21:13.054
I shall meet him...

21:13.499 --> 21:16.335
I shall take on the Mutsu Enmei Style!

21:16.335 --> 21:17.537
<i>I shall take on the Mutsu Enmei Style!
To be continued...</i>

21:17.537 --> 21:21.303
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.452 --> 21:44.455
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.730 --> 21:54.503
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.640 --> 22:03.639
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.783 --> 22:14.421
<i>Even if it's just hello,
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.461 --> 22:21.627
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.001 --> 22:24.993
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.872 --> 22:32.141
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.445 --> 22:37.940
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.665 --> 22:55.225
Someone by the name of Mutsu
accosts Iori on his way to...

22:55.334 --> 22:57.199
...the Shogun's Tournament.

22:57.303 --> 22:59.601
And a one-eyed warrior appears...

23:00.740 --> 23:02.469
Next episode of the Age of Chaos...

23:02.608 --> 23:04.098
<i>TAKATO AND TSUBURA</i>

23:04.210 --> 23:06.110
Pay close attention, and wait!
